hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1147","(164) Anwatan fatah shuda zameen par kharaj muqarrar karne ki daleel ka bab: Hasan ibn Ali ibn Affan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Adam - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhayr ne Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se, un ke walid se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Iraq apna qafeez aur dirham rok lega, Sham apna mudy aur dinar rok lega, Misr apna irdabb aur dinar rok lega, aur tum wahan laut jaoge jahan se tum ne ibteda ki thi, ise teen martaba kaha. Abu Hurayrah ka gosht aur khoon is par gawah hai."
